OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FWet and
OL,6,Fwindy this evening, with outbreaks of
OL,7,Frain, heavy at times, clearing by
OL,8,Faround midnight. Drier conditions then
OL,9,Ffollow with some clear spells
OL,10,Fdeveloping through the early hours,
OL,11,Falthough it will remain windy with the
OL,12,Fodd shower possible.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FA mixture of sunny spells and
OL,15,Fshowers, some of which will be heavy
OL,16,Fand perhaps thundery. Winds freshening
OL,17,Fonce again to give a rather cool feel
OL,18,Fto the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
